          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/66776840beb558f7e84451c2c55457f0e06242f0"
        }
      ],
      "message": "net: Skip cs_main when a peer has no orphan work\n\nProcessMessages reconsiders a peer's orphan transactions before taking\nits next message, and took cs_main for this even when the peer had\nnone. Check for orphan work under m_tx_download_mutex first, so that a\nmessage from a peer without orphan work does not wait for a busy\nchainstate.\n\nTest that ProcessMessages completes for such a peer while cs_main is\nheld.",
